{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>Their idols:</b> He mentioned the greatness of HaShem and that the gods of the nations have no power, and he called them עצבים (idols), for they are a source of עצבון (grief) to their worshippers and do not benefit them." "<b>The work of human hands:</b> It is to their shame that they worship the work of their own hands."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 115, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:39:39.771292577Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}